 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "105f8a10-0280-4059-a7a0-820947e3a167"],
 " is the pool: one geodesic DAG per admissible pair of ends, and the counts \
come from the DAGs."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"9601061c-486b-41d5-b9ee-5fd456d52452"],

