Cell["\<\
A geodesic bundle extends as one object. Six geodesics from a corner of the \
grid, twelve lines through all of them at once.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"baa98958-fc36-4050-b4d6-cf0156af0096"],

